{
  "id": "JOB.32",
  "number": "32",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 32",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "32",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So these three men ceased to answer Job, because he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "righteous in his own eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then was kindled the wrath of Elihu the son of Barachel the Buzite, of the kindred of Ram: against Job was his wrath kindled, because he justified himself rather than God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also against his three friends was his wrath kindled, because they had found no answer, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yet",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had condemned Job.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Elihu had waited till Job had spoken, because they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elder than he.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Elihu saw that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no answer in the mouth of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "these",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "three men, then his wrath was kindled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Elihu the son of Barachel the Buzite answered and said, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "young, and ye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "very old; wherefore I was afraid, and durst not shew you mine opinion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I said, Days should speak, and multitude of years should teach wisdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a spirit in man: and the inspiration of the Almighty giveth them understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Great men are not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "always",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wise: neither do the aged understand judgment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore I said, Hearken to me; I also will shew mine opinion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I waited for your words; I gave ear to your reasons, whilst ye searched out what to say.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, I attended unto you, and, behold,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none of you that convinced Job,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that answered his words:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lest ye should say, We have found out wisdom: God thrusteth him down, not man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now he hath not directed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "words against me: neither will I answer him with your speeches.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They were amazed, they answered no more: they left off speaking.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I had waited, (for they spake not, but stood still,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "answered no more;)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "I said",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will answer also my part, I also will shew mine opinion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I am full of matter, the spirit within me constraineth me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, my belly",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as wine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.32.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.32.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath no vent; it is ready to burst like new bottles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will speak, that I may be refreshed: I will open my lips and answer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
